Finish the external panel host and keep the dashboard within its requested scope.

All visible dropdown content is positioned inside the fullscreen click-away host,
so the host's anchors cannot overwrite panel placement. Audio and media receive
visibility changes when the backdrop closes them, keeping their polling and
active state synchronized. The dashboard contains only quick actions, the
seven-day agenda and notifications; system telemetry is intentionally omitted.
The notification card shows three rows before scrolling, and the French power
profile label matches the feature's actual meaning.

